nbsp;</p></font><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><font color=\"#0060ff\" size=\"3\"></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">메일 클라이언트</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">아웃룩</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, Eudora </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">에서 우리학교 메일서버</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(mail.kumoh.ac.kr)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">를</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">사용하여 메일을 송수신 할 때 사용하는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">SMTP/</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">POP3 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">프로토콜의 해킹 위험성 감소와 보안</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">강화를</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">위하여 다음과 같이 암호화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(SSL) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">통신으로 변경하오니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">메일 클라이언트 사용자께서는</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">반드시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">설정을 변경하시어 메일 수신이 원활히 되도록 조치하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">암호화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(SSL)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">설정 및 변경</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">내역</span></p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; mso-table-overlap: never\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.7pt solid; HEIGHT: 39.51pt; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 76.25pt; BACKGROUND: #e6eef7; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt\" valign=\"middle\" rowspan=\"2\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">구분</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.7pt solid; HEIGHT: 21.17pt; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 116.75pt; BACKGROUND: #e6eef7; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt\" valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"2\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">포트번호</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.7pt solid; HEIGHT: 39.51pt; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 150.32pt; BACKGROUND: #e6eef7; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt soli